<script setup>
import { computed, ref } from 'vue'
import { useLearning, percent } from '../store'
const store=useLearning(), topic=ref(store.goalId || store.nodes[0]?.id || '')
const r=computed(() => store.report)
const points=computed(() => (r.value?.trend || []).filter(t=>t.knowledge_id===topic.value).slice(-20))
const line=computed(() => points.value.map((p,i)=>`${40+i*(620/Math.max(points.value.length-1,1))},${190-p.mastery*160}`).join(' '))
</script>
<template><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">学习记录 · 可追溯的变化</p><h1>看见自己的学习轨迹</h1><p>所有指标来自已保存的答题记录；掌握度是启发式估计，不是校准后的能力概率。</p></div><button class="secondary" @click="store.run(store.refresh)">刷新报告</button></div><template v-if="r"><div v-if="r.simulated" class="callout">当前含 {{ r.simulated }} 条模拟历史，用于展示不同学习起点。其余 {{ r.total-r.simulated }} 条为实际操作记录。</div><div class="metrics"><div><span>累计答题量</span><strong data-testid="report-total">{{ r.total }}</strong></div><div><span>答对 / 全部尝试</span><strong>{{ r.correct }}<small> / {{ r.total }}</small></strong></div><div><span>正确率</span><strong>{{ percent(r.accuracy) }}</strong></div><div><span>有效样本</span><strong>{{ r.effective }}</strong></div></div><section class="panel trend-panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>掌握度变化</h2><p>每个点对应一次有效作答，最近最多显示 20 个点。</p></div><label>知识点<select v-model="topic"><option v-for="n in store.nodes" :key="n.id" :value="n.id">{{ n.name }}</option></select></label></div><svg v-if="points.length" viewBox="0 0 700 230" role="img" :aria-label="`${store.name(topic)}掌握度趋势`" class="trend-chart"><line v-for="y in [30,70,110,150,190]" :key="y" x1="40" :y1="y" x2="660" :y2="y" stroke="#e5e3f5"/><text x="0" y="35">100%</text><text x="10" y="195">0%</text><polyline :points="line" fill="none" stroke="#534ab7" stroke-width="3"/><circle v-for="(p,i) in points" :key="p.attempt_id" :cx="40+i*(620/Math.max(points.length-1,1))" :cy="190-p.mastery*160" r="4" fill="#534ab7"><title>{{ p.date }}：{{ percent(p.mastery) }} / {{ p.samples }} 条样本</title></circle><text x="40" y="220">{{ points[0].date }}</text><text x="580" y="220">{{ points.at(-1).date }}</text></svg><div v-else class="empty compact">此知识点尚无有效记录。完成未见题练习后，趋势将在这里出现。</div></section><section class="panel"><h2>知识点掌握情况</h2><div v-for="n in r.knowledge" :key="n.id" class="mastery-row"><RouterLink :to="`/knowledge?node=${n.id}`">{{ n.name }}</RouterLink><div class="progress-track"><i :style="{width:`${(n.mastery||0)*100}%`}"></i></div><strong>{{ percent(n.mastery) }}</strong><small>{{ n.samples }} 条有效 / {{ n.distinct_count }} 道题</small><span class="badge">{{ n.status }}</span></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>每日作答记录</h2><p class="muted">服务端日期口径：{{ r.timezone }}；正确率包含复习尝试。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>日期</th><th>答题次数</th><th>答对</th><th>有效样本</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="d in r.daily" :key="d.date"><td>{{ d.date }}</td><td>{{ d.attempts }}</td><td>{{ d.correct }}</td><td>{{ d.effective }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p v-if="!r.daily.length">还没有作答记录。</p></section></template></template>
